    - target: {fileID: 6776095060359607615, guid: 24e70d00260178029b36ff84b19525b4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Calling the police didn''t do anything. They arrived not long after
        your departure, but those "long men" were nowhere to be found. The entire
        tunnel was empty and silent.


        One brave officer decided to venture
        deeper into the hole that connected the metro with an underground pond, but
        it also turned out to be empty. How deep the water goes, however, is anyone''s
        guess. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
