      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Exposition
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6776095060359607615, guid: 24e70d00260178029b36ff84b19525b4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'This marked the last time you ever worked as a civil inspector. You
        are no stranger to squatters or the homeless, but this was something different,
        something more sinister...


        Employers didn''t make much of a fuss
        about your decision. In fact, it looked as if they were relieved. They even
        agreed on paying you three times your monthly income. Strange as their behavior
        might be, you are unbothered to pursue their motives. The nightmare is over,
        and this is all that matters.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
